@startuml Build Failure Scenarios (Simplified)

title Build Failure — Timeout Detection & Race Condition

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F4F8
skinparam noteBorderColor #DAA520
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFACD
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderThickness 1
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999999
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left

actor       "User"               as U
participant "Web Frontend"       as FE
participant "Backend API"        as BE
participant "Automation Worker"  as W
participant "Proxmox Hypervisor" as PX

== Normal Start (abbreviated) ==

W -> BE : progress (stage=EXECUTE_SCRIPTS)
BE --> W : ACK

== Worker Failure ==

note over W #FFCCCC
  WORKER CRASH
  Process dies, VM hangs, or
  network partitions. No deregistration.
end note

...

== Timeout Detection ==

note over BE
  Backend periodically checks for stale jobs
  (no progress within timeout window).
end note

BE -> BE : Mark job FAILED

== Frontend Discovers Failure ==

FE -> BE : GET /api/builds/{id}
BE --> FE : state=FAILED
FE --> U  : Display failure reason

== Race Condition: Late Completion ==

note over W #FEF5E7
  Worker was slow, not crashed —
  finishes after backend already failed the job.
end note

W -[#FF6600]-> BE : POST …/complete (late attempt)
BE -> BE : State already FAILED — cannot transition to READY
BE -[#CC0000]-> W : 409 Conflict

note over W #FFE5E5
  Worker cleans up build VM and export
  artefacts on rejection.
end note

@enduml
